{"text": "Allen M. Gutierrez\nPresident\nTheMCA Group\n\nreer i 7\n\nFounder of The MCA Group based in Maryland with emphasis on Federal & private sector procurement, special\nevents management and multicultural marketing.\n\nTeam leader with a focused career on creating a winning environment for organizations and stakeholders alike.\nExpertise includes establishing key relationships in both the public and private sector. Community experience ranges\nfrom national, state, local professional associations and community organizations. Skills and experience include:\n\nSmall Business e Government Relation\nBrand Management e Account Management\n\nMarketing\n\nStrategic Management\n\nCommunications Building Relationship\nBilingual English/Spanish Business Management & Mentorship\nEmployee Management\n\nProfessional Experience\n\nThe Latino Coalition, Washington, DC Dec. 2007 \u2014 Present\n\nManage day-to-day operations\nOversee relationship with all sustaining Corporate Partners\nRepresent organization on all external relations\nResponsible for developing and growing the group\u2019s membership and benefits\n\nUnited States Hispanic Chamber of Commerce, Washington, DC Aug. 2005 to Nov. 2007\n\nOversight of all internal operations of the organization.\nResponsible for all Human Resources matters for a staff of 20+ employees\nManaged annual budget of approximately $8 million a year.\nOversee the implementation of all memoranda of understanding (MOU\u2019s) and strategic alliance\nagreements between the USHCC and other non-profit organization and corporate partners.\nExecuted in first year an overall cost saving of approximately $300k while improving our\nproducts and services.",
